usage: setting_tool [-h] --base BASE [--settings-file SETTINGS_FILE] [--json]
                    [--dry-run]
                    {get,set,list,defaults} ...

Read and update DIL global settings with defaults

positional arguments:
  {get,set,list,defaults}
    get                 read one setting, falling back to defaults
    set                 add or update one setting
    list                list settings
    defaults            list built-in defaults

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base BASE           DIL base path
  --settings-file SETTINGS_FILE
                        settings registry path (default:
                        _shared/_meta/agent_runtime_policy.json)
  --json                emit JSON
  --dry-run             preview without side effects
